Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 17:43:06 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 09/12] nyx_dshot: 8 motor lines with the FC block's version 3
 (the NyxHop baseboard's CH1..8: NYX_PWM_OUTS 8 bits, NYX_PWM_MIN/MAX/DIS1..8,
 8 output channels); nyx_fcio.hpp: version 3 registers (lines 5..8, CAPS),
 lines(), hil(); the read-back only where the block has it (HIL); SIH_PL_IO
 refuses a block without HIL

